---
import BaseLayout from '../../components/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../../components/PageHeader.astro';
---
<BaseLayout section="goodwellness" title="Research & Education">
  <PageHeader title="Research & Education" description="Research, clinical practice, and professional learning in rehabilitation robotics." />
  <section class="section"><div class="container-page">
    <div class="center-overview"><div><p class="center-kicker">50+ SCI-indexed publications</p><h2>Evidence-based rehabilitation robotics</h2></div><div><p>Research conducted through RoboGym has contributed to more than 50 SCI-indexed international publications in rehabilitation robotics and related fields.</p><p>The center connects clinical application with the development of assessment and treatment technologies, clinical trials, and professional education.</p></div></div>
    <div class="center-card-grid center-technology-grid">
      <article class="center-card"><h3>Research</h3><p>Developing and evaluating rehabilitation technologies through research and clinical trials.</p><a class="text-link" href="/publications/">SMART Lab publications <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
      <article class="center-card"><h3>Clinical practice</h3><p>Applying rehabilitation robotics in a community setting and connecting technical knowledge with clinical experience.</p><a class="text-link" href="/goodwellness/robogym/">Inside RoboGym <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
      <article class="center-card"><h3>Education</h3><p>Professional learning for students, clinicians, researchers, and engineers working with rehabilitation robotics.</p><a class="text-link" href="/training/">SMART Lab training resources <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
    </div>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
